                "message": "fix(toxav): harden video processing and fix large frame handling\n\n- Remove invalid vpx_img_free call in vc_iterate.\n- Make vc_reconfigure_encoder atomic and add resolution limits.\n- Support 32-bit RTPMessage lengths to correctly handle large frames.\n- Ensure len is correctly set for assembled video frames.\n- Add security checks for incoming frame sizes and resolutions.\n- Significantly expand video and rtp unit tests covering security scenarios.\n- Clean up VCSession structure and improve internal API consistency.\n- Use #define for security constants in video module.",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "daeb603bf65f8f1d9d97c58d88b22f153738f9fc",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/c-toxcore/git/trees/daeb603bf65f8f1d9d97c58d88b22f153738f9fc"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/c-toxcore/git/commits/da1c13a2f90d86d4f9a1692f9ffb8112db48cb69",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree daeb603bf65f8f1d9d97c58d88b22f153738f9fc\nparent 47282528883d7b2474b82bf1a5f977dc2c0aa6c4\nauthor iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1766871931 +0000\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1767131954 +0000\n\nfix(toxav): harden video processing and fix large frame handling\n\n- Remove invalid vpx_img_free call in vc_iterate.\n- Make vc_reconfigure_encoder atomic and add resolution limits.\n- Support 32-bit RTPMessage lengths to correctly handle large frames.\n- Ensure len is correctly set for assembled video frames.\n- Add security checks for incoming frame sizes and resolutions.\n- Significantly expand video and rtp unit tests covering security scenarios.\n- Clean up VCSession structure and improve internal API consistency.\n- Use #define for security constants in video module.\n",
